[4.106, "o", "\r\n\u001b[32m- **get_agent_metadata** → 8 subagents: Account Management, Case Management, Delivery Issues, Escalation, General FAQ, Order Inquiries, Reservation Management, Service Customer Verification\r\n\r\n# Chapter 2 — Live Testing\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.797, "o", "\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mstart_session\u001b[0m\u001b[90m({\"targetOrg\":\"sfagent-dev\",\"agentApiName\":\"Agentforce_Service_Agent\",\"scenarioName\":\"demo-walkthrough\"})\u001b[0m\r\n"]
