[17.354, "o", "\r\n\u001b[32m## Demo summary\r\n\r\n| # | Tool | Result |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| 1 | `list_orgs` | `sfagent-dev` scratch org, Connected |\r\n| 2 | `list_agents` | 1 agent: `Agentforce_Service_Agent` |\r\n| 3 | `get_agent_metadata` | 8 subagents (Account Mgmt, Case Mgmt, Delivery, Escalation, FAQ, Orders, Reservations, Verification) |\r\n| 4 | `load_config` | 8 topic expectations, 5 global rules, 3 custom scenarios |\r\n| 5 | `start_session` | sessionId `019e5ab4…3e2a`, live transcript streaming |\r\n| 6 | `send_message` \"Can you help me with my order?\" | Agent requested email/username for ID verification |\r\n| 7 | `send_message` \"My email is sarah.johnson@acme.com\" | Agent sent verification code, awaiting it |\r\n| 8 | `generate_test_spec` | 2-case YAML written to `sfagent-reports/demo-suite.yaml` |\r\n| 9 | `end_session` | Closed with `pass`, 4-message transcript returned |\r\n| 10 | `list_traces` | **Denied — permission not granted** |\r\n| 11 | `read_trace` | **Denied — permission not granted** |\r\n\r\nChapters 1–3 ran clean. Chapter "]
[0.000, "o", "4 (diagnostics) was blocked by permission denials — happy to retry if you approve.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
